index 0000000..efdfeb0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/enabled-false-call-passthrough-3f8a2c1d9e7b4a06.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    `Retrying(enabled=False)(fn)` and `AsyncRetrying(enabled=False)(fn)` now
+    call `fn` once and propagate its exception unchanged, as the decorator and
+    iterator forms already did. Previously calling the retrying object ran the
+    full retry loop and raised `RetryError` wrapping the original exception.
